  itemID: doc5.2
  itemName: Valentino's Journal - Entry 5 (of 5)
  itemType: 1
  icon: {fileID: -811217553, guid: 44bb429c66c7df816b55d41878254ce0, type: 3}
  description: 
  fileText: '"If something happens to me before I can tell her - she should know
    that none of it was her fault in the way she''ll think it was. The deal was made
    before she knew what she was making. The price wasn''t set by her. And whatever
    she wished for at the crossroads, she was wishing to be free. People have wished
    for worse things. She should know that. She should know that I loved her in a
    way I didn''t know how to make safe, and that I''m sorry for that part. - V."'
